      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "There are several masks that can be added to the helmet, and most of these make the user less visible to certain creatures. The rest are more specific, such as the Eye masks which make one immune to Stalkers. The Piglin and Pumpkin masks will make Piglins and Enderman neutral to the wearer. Spyglass Goggles have a zoom feature and Great Stool summons a stool below the user."
